    kind: work_item  # e26d
    title: "The SCIP importer mints a Symbol per local binding named by its SCIP local id ('1', '3', '102'), collapsing stable_id for 498 of 1255 Symbols (39.7% collision) and degenerating fingerprints"  # e26d
    status: todo_hard  # e26d
    priority: 2  # e26d
